  "zh": "# APEC深圳峰会引领多边外交，AI商业化加速与金融市场震荡并行\n## 国际视野\n- **APEC深圳峰会中俄美三方会晤**：习近平主场外交推动亚太互联互通，三大国元首罕见同框释放强烈信号。\n- **英国承认向苹果发秘密加密令**：揭示西方政府加密后门争议升级，隐私与安全博弈白热化。\n## AI 与前沿科技\n- **大模型圈地结束进入收费时代**：头部模型商业化加速，免费红利消退，开发者面临新成本压力。\n- **Anthropic纳斯达克上市**：AI独角兽登陆资本市场，标志生成式AI进入规模化盈利新阶段。\n## 商业与金融\n- **爱奇艺股价连续破1美元面临退市**：长视频平台盈利困境加剧，退市风险倒逼内容变革。\n- **现货黄金跌破3600美元**：避险情绪降温拖累金价，市场开始重新定价通胀预期。\n## 航天与硬科技\n- **朱雀三号回收火箭传好消息**：国产可复用火箭关键技术突破，降低发射成本迈出实质步伐。\n- **OpenSSL高危缓冲区溢出漏洞**：CVSS 9.8 级漏洞波及全球加密库，紧急修补成安全运维首要任务。",
  "en": "# APEC Shenzhen summit drives multilateral diplomacy as AI monetization accelerates and markets tumble\n## Geopolitics\n- **APEC Shenzhen Trilateral Summit**: Xi's host diplomacy pushes Asia-Pacific connectivity as the three leaders share a rare stage.\n- **UK Admits Secret Apple Encryption Order**: The row over government-mandated backdoors intensifies, pitting privacy against security.\n## AI & Frontier Tech\n- **Large Model Land Grab Ends Paid Era**: Top models shift to paid tiers, ending free-access perks and raising developer costs.\n- **Anthropic Nasdaq IPO**: The AI unicorn's market debut signals generative AI's move toward large-scale profitability.\n## Business & Finance\n- **iQiyi Stock Below $1 Faces Delisting**: Persistent losses push the video platform toward a delisting warning, forcing a content overhaul.\n- **Spot Gold Falls Below $3600**: Easing safe-haven demand drags gold lower, prompting a reassessment of inflation expectations.\n## Space & Hard Tech\n- **Zhuque-3 Rocket Recovery Success**: China's reusable rocket achieves a key milestone, cutting launch costs substantially.\n- **OpenSSL Critical Buffer Overflow CVE-2026-121481**: A CVSS 9.8 flaw hits the core crypto library, making emergency patching a top priority."
